<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:42:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>癌细胞释放抗氧化剂以防止免疫细胞破坏它们</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-cells-release-antioxidants-to-prevent-immune-cells-from-destroying-them</link><description>活性氧分子（包括所谓的“自由基”）长期以来一直被视为人体新陈代谢的有害副产品，因此抗氧化剂补充剂被认为是降低癌症风险的潜在方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cancer-cells-release-antioxidants-to-prevent-immune-cells-from-destroying-them2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:42:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-cells-release-antioxidants-to-prevent-immune-cells-from-destroying-them</guid></item><item><title>裸盖菇素可预防临床前模型中化疗相关的神经损伤和相关症状</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/psilocybin-prevents-chemotherapy-related-nerve-injury-and-associated-symptoms-in-preclinical-models</link><description>在一项突破性研究中，德克萨斯大学 MD 安德森癌症中心的研究人员发现，化疗前给予裸盖菇素可以预防临床前模型中神经损伤的发生，即使在重复治疗周期后也是如此。这些发现可能有助于预防疼痛、麻木和其他常见的化疗副作用。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/psilocybin-prevents-chemotherapy-related-nerve-injury-and-associated-symptoms-in-preclinical-models.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:27:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/psilocybin-prevents-chemotherapy-related-nerve-injury-and-associated-symptoms-in-preclinical-models</guid></item><item><title>Bassel函数MCQ题| 2025 号门</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/mcq-question-of-bassel-function-gate-2025</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:12:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/mcq-question-of-bassel-function-gate-2025</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局发现地球微生物可以在月球上生存</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-finds-earth-microbes-could-survive-on-the-moon</link><description>美国宇航局科学家发现，宇航员带来的微生物可以在月球南极周围寒冷、阴暗的环境中生存，这可能会使未来寻找原始月球化学物质的工作变得更加复杂。有些避难所可能不超过一个脚印，而一种耐寒的真菌甚至可以承受有限的阳光照射。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-finds-earth-microbes-could-survive-on-the-moon.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 13:57:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nasa-finds-earth-microbes-could-survive-on-the-moon</guid></item><item><title>科学家们刚刚对分子隐藏的量子形状进行了成像</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-just-imaged-the-hidden-quantum-shape-of-a-molecule</link><description>研究人员找到了一种方法来创建分子波函数的完整 3D 图像，这是量子力学最基本但又难以捉摸的特征之一。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-just-imaged-the-hidden-quantum-shape-of-a-molecule.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 13:42:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-just-imaged-the-hidden-quantum-shape-of-a-molecule</guid></item><item><title>就业大灾难被推迟。人工智能就业热潮已经来临</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-jobs-apocalypse-is-postponed-an-ai-jobs-boom-is-here</link><description>该技术对就业的初步影响看起来是积极的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-jobs-apocalypse-is-postponed-an-ai-jobs-boom-is-here2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 13:27:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-jobs-apocalypse-is-postponed-an-ai-jobs-boom-is-here</guid></item><item><title>大规模国际研究发现 1 型糖尿病实际上可能是两种不同的疾病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/type-1-diabetes-may-actually-be-two-different-diseases-massive-international-study-finds</link><description>识别独特的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/type-1-diabetes-may-actually-be-two-different-diseases-massive-international-study-